guide forever-dungeon-quests/blackrock-spire-alliance
title Blackrock Spire (Alliance)
category Dungeons
folder Blackrock Spire
faction Alliance
levels 57-60
zone Burning Steppes
keywords Blackrock Spire, Lower Blackrock Spire, Upper Blackrock Spire, Blackrock Mountain, Burning Steppes, Morgan's Vigil, Flame Crest, Marshal Maxwell, Bijou, Message to Maxwell, Maxwell's Mission, General Drakkisath, Helendis Riverhorn, Halycon, Mayara Brightwing, Doomrigger's Clasp, Count Remington Ridgewell, Kibler, Worg Pup, Spire Spider Eggs, Ragged John, Mother's Milk, Mother Smolderweb, Warosh, Urok Doomhowl, Tinkee Steamboil, Egg Freezing, Seal of Ascension, Vaelan, Emberstrife, Duke Hydraxis, Eye of the Emberseer, Kilram, Snakestone, Lorax, The Demon Forge, Goraluk Anvilcrack, Awbee, Haleh, Pip Quickwit, Malyfous Darkhammer, Prospector Ironboot, Mosh'aru, Rend Blackhand, End of the Dark Horde, dungeon
why Every Alliance quest of Blackrock Spire, the Lower Spire first and the Upper Spire on the second run.

# Blackrock Spire's Alliance quests in one guide: Prospector Ironboot in
# Tanaris, Duke Hydraxis in Azshara, Winterspring, Silithus, the Eastern
# Plaguelands, the Burning Steppes (Morgan's Vigil and Flame Crest), a first
# run in the Lower Spire, the hand-ins and the Seal of Ascension's forging in
# the Wyrmbog, a second run back through the Lower Spire into the Upper
# Spire, then the last hand-ins. Steps already done are passed over, so the
# guide picks up wherever the chain stands.
#
# The chains:
# - Bijou's 5001 Bijou's Belongings -> 5002 Message to Maxwell -> Marshal
#   Maxwell's 5081 Maxwell's Mission (the second run); Overlord Wyrmthalak's
#   General Drakkisath's Command 5089 -> 5102 General Drakkisath's Demise.
# - Helendis Riverhorn's 4701 Put Her Down; Mayara Brightwing's 4764
#   Doomrigger's Clasp -> 4765 Delivery to Ridgewell.
# - Kibler's 4729 Kibler's Exotic Pets and 4862 En-Ay-Es-Tee-Why; Ragged
#   John's 4866 Mother's Milk; Tinkee Steamboil's 4726 Broodling Essence ->
#   4808 -> Felnok Steelspring's 4809 Chillwind Horns -> 4810 Return to Tinkee
#   -> 4734 Egg Freezing.
# - Vaelan's 4742 -> 4743 Seal of Ascension (the key to the Upper Spire).
# - Warosh's 4867 Urok Doomhowl; Kilram's 5306 Snakestone of the Shadow
#   Huntress; Lorax's 5126 -> 5127 The Demon Forge; Awbee's 5160 The Matron
#   Protectorate -> Haleh's 5161; Pip Quickwit's 5047 (to Malyfous
#   Darkhammer).
# - Duke Hydraxis' 6804 Poisoned Water and 6805 Stormers and Rumblers -> 6821
#   Eye of the Emberseer.
# - For characters who handed in The God Hakkar (3528, in the Sunken Temple
#   guide), Prospector Ironboot's 5065 The Lost Tablets of Mosh'aru -> 4788
#   The Final Tablets.
# - The Head of Rend Blackhand starts 84377 End of the Dark Horde.
#
# Left out: 6502 Drakefire Amulet (the Onyxia attunement); 7761 Blackhand's
# Command (the Blackwing Lair attunement); 4735 Egg Collection (it opens only
# after Egg Freezing's hand-in outside, so it would need a third run); the
# breadcrumbs 4907 (behind a Winterspring chain) and 4766 from Stormwind;
# 5162 and on after Haleh, 6822 The Molten Core after Hydraxis, 8181 after
# The Final Tablets; 5166 and 5167 (they need Stratholme and Scholomance);
# the Dungeon Set 2 and Valthalak quests (8931 to 9006).
#
# Inside: nothing in the data places the bosses, the NPCs or the objects
# inside, so their goals stand at the door (@34.8,85.3, Searing Gorge): the
# Lower Spire's with `group 5`, the Upper Spire's with `group 10`, as the
# client's group finder lists them (Lower 55 to 60 for five players, Upper 59
# to 60 for ten). The bosses come in the order of the client's dungeon
# journal; every quest goal is counted by the quest log, so a group that
# takes them in another order still gets each step ticked. Most of these
# quests ask for level 57, so the guide does.
#
# Sources (facts only):
# - Quests, NPCs, items, objects and rewards: Polestar's reference data
#   (data/forever, built from QuestieDB Forever 1.1.4) and Polestar 0.4.1.1's
#   Codex page for the dungeon. Each gemstone of command drops one time in
#   ten (data/forever); the Forged Seal comes from an object in the Wyrmbog;
#   the data names no source for the Orb of Draconic Energy that 4743 needs,
#   nor for the Caged Worg Pup. Lint warns that the door is more than 50
#   yards from the Unadorned Seal's droppers outside; the goal stays at the
#   door for the ones inside.
# - The door: players' recordings, as Polestar's Codex holds them
#   (data/codex/entrances.json).
# INGAME: where inside do Vaelan, Bijou, Warosh, Awbee and Pip Quickwit
#   stand, and where does the Orb of Draconic Energy come from?

